<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Siebe takeover of APV.</title>
<headline>EU clears Siebe takeover of APV.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Thursday it had cleared the acquisition of APV, a British company which supplies equipment and services to the food and drinks industries, by British engineering group Siebe.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the companies' activities overlapped only in the field of industrial process control systems and that their market position was not such that it gave rise to competition concerns.</p>
</text>
